## Next Steps for User

To complete the Vercel Web Analytics setup:

1. **Enable Analytics in Vercel Dashboard**
   - Navigate to your project in the Vercel dashboard
   - Go to the Analytics tab
   - Click the "Enable" button

2. **Deploy the Changes**
   - Push this branch to your repository
   - Deploy to Vercel (automatic if linked to git)

3. **Verify Tracking**
   - After deployment, visit your site
   - Open browser DevTools → Network tab
   - Look for requests to analytics endpoints
   - Check the Analytics dashboard for incoming data

## Notes

- The `@vercel/analytics` package was already installed, so no package.json modifications were needed
- Analytics will work in both development and production environments
- The implementation follows the official Vercel documentation for React/Vite projects
- No breaking changes were introduced; all existing functionality remains intact
